{
	"info": {
		"name": "OpenRegister — object actions",
		"description": "object-actions-declared-and-run task 6.2: the five routes. A schema declares `publish` (inputs, a `when`, an `object-write` step, offered on the bulk surface) and `close` (bound to the lifecycle transition `sluiten`, which needs `reden`); its authorization grants both to admin only. Covered: the list with availability and reason, the refusal order on a run (404 unknown, 403 no right before 409, 409 `action-precondition-unmet` before 422, 422 invalid inputs, 422 a body the engine refuses), a completed run and its write, the history newest first, the bulk surface and a run on a selection. Every action entry carries `name` and `description`: without them `DeclaredActions` does not count the key as declared and the authorization block may not grant it.\n\nCreates its own reader, register, schema and objects and deletes them. Requests send no cookies: Nextcloud prefers a session cookie over the Basic header, so a jar would run the reader's request as the administrator.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"[['baseUrl', 'base_url'], ['username', 'admin_user'], ['password', 'admin_password']].forEach(function (pair) {",
					"    var given = pm.environment.get(pair[1]);",
					"    if (given !== undefined && given !== '') {",
					"        pm.collectionVariables.set(pair[0], given);",
					"    }",
					"});",
					"if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('stamp')) {",
					"    pm.collectionVariables.set('stamp', 'oact' + Date.now().toString(36));",
					"}",
					"pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', Buffer.from(pm.collectionVariables.get('username') + ':' + pm.collectionVariables.get('password')).toString('base64'));",
					"pm.collectionVariables.set('readerToken', Buffer.from(pm.collectionVariables.get('stamp') + '-reader:' + pm.collectionVariables.get('readerPassword')).toString('base64'));"
				]
			}
		}
	],
